  "description": "The 29\" Big Ripper has a legendary history—it was the first 29\" BMX bike ever produced! Its Floval tubing frame with Looptail rear end has strong ties to the original legendary PK Ripper. The special edition ODI Mushroom grips provide great feel, and the new SE Captive seat provides a secure and comfortable ride. The bike rolls like a dream with double-wall rims, sealed bearing hubs, and plenty of grip from the 29 x 2.4” SE Bozack tires. And they will definitely hear you coming this year as this bike is equipped with the new 9-pawl, 108 clicks LOUD freewheel. This is the bike that started the big BMX craze, and it’s not done yet!",
